# SCENARIO: b7_104_rescue_hidden   SEED: 0   CAMERAS: none   BOTCFG: auto
# #104 disguised rescues. A pinned bot stands next to a harness player (p1) in Thais, 20+ tiles from the
# temple, and the engine's teleport-home rescue fires (`/cavebot <bot> rescue` = teleportToTemple with
# rescue=true, the path every abort/stuck rescue takes). Watched where it stands, the jump is deferred:
# the bot walks out of p1's view, and only then jumps -- p1 never sees it vanish in place.
# Run: runner.py b7_104_rescue_hidden.steps --var R=<Thais bot>
# Acceptance: reply "deferred (watched)"; [RESCUE_TP] done bot=R how=walked|waited (never fallback) within
#   120 s; p1 saw the bot walk (see_move) and lose sight of it only after it walked (see_disappear), and the
#   post-check (.work/batch7/realism/rescue_check.py on cli-p1.ndjson) finds no see_move jump > 1 tile and a last-seen
#   position at the edge of the view (>= 7 tiles from p1). Second arm: the same rescue with nobody
#   watching is the plain jump ([RESCUE_TP] not deferred, reply "done").
# PRECONDITION: b7_realism_setup.steps ran: the bot is debug-pinned and audited (it pins and watches all
# batch-7 realism bots at once, because reload debug and the audit settings are global).
@p1 login
@p1 goto 32369,32215,7 range=2 stuck=15 timeout=120
@p1 goto 32351,32215,7 range=2 stuck=15 timeout=120
@srv cmd "$R" teleport 32353,32216,7
@p1 wait-see "$R" timeout=30
@p1 hold 4
@srv audit mark "B7-104 A: watched rescue"
@srv cmd "$R" rescue expect="rescue: deferred \(watched\)"
@srv expect src=srv msg~="\[RESCUE_TP\] done bot='$R' site=teleportToTemple how=(walked|waited)" min=1 within=130 wait=125
@srv expect-none src=srv msg~="\[RESCUE_TP\] done bot='$R' .*how=fallback" within=140
@srv expect src=cli:p1 k=see_disappear bot=$R min=1 within=140
@p1 hold 5
@srv audit mark "B7-104 B: unwatched rescue"
@srv cmd "$R" teleport 32369,32237,7
@srv sleep 3
@srv cmd "$R" rescue expect="rescue: done"
@srv audit mark "B7-104 end"
@srv expect-none src=srv msg~="Lua Script Error" within=300
@p1 logout
